      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The words of wisdom left here by the Lord Ravager known as \"Zephyro\":"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-386a9a856e3f0b94"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The blazing sun that was never meant to rise now walks the path to Elevation, granted by The Blemished One."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yet he continues to defy his destiny."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "He would crash a thousand times over, just to inflict another wound upon that God."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A wound so slight, it merits but a glance..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And a sliver of grace is granted for this fury that tears through the veil of Erudition."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Through this battle, I have tested the flames that forge Irontomb on THEIR behalf."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Our brethren, soon to be unleashed, the who walks the Path of Destruction."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "THEY await your coronation,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "to jointly declare that the sun of old has been devoured and buried by a darkness ever deeper."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-08c6454f68efbf0a"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
